OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of fire-struck pub
OL,4,Agiven green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former pub in Shrewsbury that was
OL,7,Fpartially destroyed by fire is to be
OL,8,Fdemolished.
OL,10,FShropshire Council's planners gave the
OL,11,Fgo-ahead for the Oxon Priory, which was
OL,12,Fowned by brewer Greene King but had
OL,13,Fclosed months earlier, to be knocked
OL,14,Fdown.
OL,16,FFire crews from five different stations
OL,17,Fwere called to deal with the blaze on 6
OL,18,FOctober 2025. Subsequently three boys,
OL,19,Fone aged 12 and two aged 13, were
OL,20,Fbailed after being arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of arson, West Mercia Police
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
