OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of fire-struck pub
OL,4,Agiven green light
OL,5,
OL,6,FDocuments submitted to the authority
OL,7,Fsaid the demolition would happen in
OL,8,Fphases, starting with the unaffected
OL,9,Fsingle-storey sections, before moving
OL,10,Fon to the fire-damaged parts of the
OL,11,Fbuilding.
